=== reject/variables/bad-optional-chain.nu
shape shape_internalcall 0..3 "let"
shape shape_vardecl 4..5 "x"
shape shape_record 8..9 "{"
shape shape_string 9..10 "a"
shape shape_record 10..12 ": "
shape shape_int 12..13 "1"
shape shape_record 13..14 "}"
shape shape_variable 15..17 "$x"
shape shape_string 18..19 "a"
shape shape_string 21..22 "b"
shape shape_string 24..25 "c"
error nu::parser::parse_mismatch: Parse mismatch: expected . or ?.
  label 26..27 "!": expected . or ?
  help: Check the syntax around this position — a typo, missing delimiter, or wrong separator is common.
=== reject/variables/dollar-alone.nu
shape shape_garbage 0..1 "$"
shape shape_garbage 2..3 "a"
shape shape_garbage 3..3 ""
