  label 2..3 "a": expected operator
  help: Check the syntax around this position — a typo, missing delimiter, or wrong separator is common.
error nu::parser::incomplete_math_expression: Incomplete math expression.
  label 2..3 "a": incomplete math expression
error nu::parser::incomplete_math_expression: Incomplete math expression.
  label 2..3 "a": incomplete math expression
